This website explains the ‘8 Ways’ approach, which is an Aboriginal method of teaching and learning. Instead of focusing just on books and lectures, Aboriginal teaching values ways like visual learning, telling stories, and connecting with nature. For example, this website teaches us how storytelling can be a powerful way to share knowledge. In an Aboriginal classroom, a teacher might use a story to teach a lesson, rather than just giving instructions. This approach is very hands-on and…";}}s:10:"persistent";a:5:{s:4:"date";a:2:{s:7:"created";i:1737194953;s:8:"modified";i:1740913257;}s:7:"creator";s:15:"Minh Thu Nguyen";s:4:"user";s:13:"minhthunguyen";s:11:"last_change";a:9:{s:4:"date";i:1740913257;s:2:"ip";s:14:"203.123.64.208";s:4:"type";s:1:"E";s:2:"id";s:9:"resources";s:4:"user";s:0:"";s:3:"sum";s:0:"";s:5:"extra";s:0:"";s:10:"sizechange";i:1;s:4:"mode";s:4:"page";}s:11:"contributor";a:1:{s:13:"minhthunguyen";s:15:"Minh Thu Nguyen";}}}